---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Solutions Architect & Software Engineer</h1>

			<p>
				I'm a technology professional with 6+ years of experience spanning software
				engineering, cloud architecture, and enterprise systems. I spent four years
				as a Software Development Engineer at Amazon before moving into solutions
				architecture and technical design.
			</p>

			<p>
				My focus is on turning complex technical requirements into practical,
				scalable architectures. I work across cloud infrastructure, APIs,
				identity and access management, enterprise integrations, and application
				architecture, with experience across AWS and a range of enterprise
				platforms.
			</p>

			<h2>What I work on</h2>

			<ul>
				<li>Cloud and application architecture</li>
				<li>Enterprise integration and API design</li>
				<li>AWS and cloud infrastructure</li>
				<li>Identity, authentication, and authorization</li>
				<li>Distributed systems and integration patterns</li>
				<li>Technical documentation and architecture diagrams</li>
				<li>Evaluating technical trade-offs and communicating them to stakeholders</li>
				<li>AI-enabled applications and emerging technology</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Background</h2>

			<p>
				Before moving into architecture, I worked as a software engineer,
				building and operating production systems at scale. That engineering
				background gives me a practical perspective on architecture: designs
				need to work in the real world, not just look good on a diagram.
			</p>

			<p>
				This site is a collection of my work, technical writing, architecture
				projects, and things I'm currently learning.
			</p>

			<h2>Currently interested in</h2>

			<p>
				Cloud architecture, cybersecurity, networking, developer platforms,
				AI infrastructure, and customer-facing technical roles where I can
				work through difficult problems with both technical and business
				stakeholders.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
